    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##Exploration: Summarize Information\r\n\r\nThis chatbot will take a load of information and find the three most important details.\r\n\r\n####Task:\r\n\r\n* **Choose** one a purpose for using AI that you identified.\r\n* **Test** this AI chatbot to see how well it helps with your purpose.\r\n* **Judge** what AI did well and what it did not do well.\r\n\r\n\r\n#### How to Use This Chatbot:\r\n* Find information about your theme from another website. Copy and paste it into the chatbot.\r\n\r\n_OR_\r\n\r\n* Click the **microphone button** and talk for as long as you want about something related to your theme.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
